<title>USA: Fort Bend Cty MUD 111, Texas, won by Rauscher.</title>
<headline>Fort Bend Cty MUD 111, Texas, won by Rauscher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it won $2.770 million of Fort Bend Cty MUD 111, Texas, general obligation bonds, Sereis 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.6861 percent.</p>
